-- "What are you going through?" needs: 36 chips in editorial order, hope first (eight on Home).
-- Generated by curated-sermons/pipelines/embeddings/aao_embed/moments.py (NEEDS); edit there and
-- re-generate, or edit here by hand.
--
-- Idempotent: re-running updates label, short, theme and sort in place and adds new needs. It never
-- changes `published` on a need that already exists, so a need the ministry hides stays hidden.
-- Path ids in public.paths.needs refer to these ids (same-sin, fear, anxiety, prayer, hear-god,
-- waiting, delay, fasting, purpose, calling, holiness, grace).
--
-- Requires the need_search migration (20261015000000_need_search.sql).

begin;

on conflict (id) do update set
  label = excluded.label,
  short = excluded.short,
  theme = excluded.theme,
  sort = excluded.sort;

commit;
